  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9cedf8556705fb0459982a33aed5bac8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BestiaryFlipbookUI
  pages:
  - monsterName: Astral Lizard
    description: A low, quick creature covered in faintly shimmering scales that
      seem to flicker between colors depending on the light. Its four legs end in
      wide clawed feet built for scrambling up walls and ceilings rather than open
      ground. A crest of translucent spines runs down its spine, said to catch starlight
      even indoors. It hisses in short bursts before lunging, giving faster trappers
      a half-second warning.
  - monsterName: Blood Demon
    description: A tall, skeletal figure with mottled grey-red skin stretched so
      thin its ribs show through with every breath. He has long spikes that grow
      out of his scrawny, hunched back. This monster will stalk you when you are
      not looking, but remain lifeless if you dare to fix him with a stare. Trappers
      who've crossed one say it barely makes a sound until it's already too close.
  - monsterName: Sludge Dragon
    description: A heavyset, wingless beast dragging a trail of thick, dark residue
      wherever it moves. Its hide looks less like scales and more like drying mud,
      cracked and oozing at the joints. Two stubby horns sit low on a wide, flattened
      skull, and its bulk makes it slow but nearly impossible to stop once it's committed
      to a charge. The smell alone is usually enough to tell you one's nearby before
      you see it.
  - monsterName: Ice Wizard
    description: A gaunt, robed figure whose exposed skin has the pale, cracked look
      of frostbitten stone. Frost creeps outward from its bare feet with every step,
      and thin icicle-like growths hang from its fingers in place of nails. It rarely
      chases directly, preferring to cut off escape routes with sheets of rime that
      form faster than they should. Trappers describe the air around it as always
      a few degrees too cold.
  nameText: {fileID: 1146809067}
  descriptionText: {fileID: 1156195586}
  previousButton: {fileID: 1195966229}
  nextButton: {fileID: 1659274247}
  closeButton: {fileID: 288277131}
  openButton: {fileID: 1503892164}
  bestiaryFlipbookPanel: {fileID: 1993392685}
  forcedSortingOrder: 1000
